//! Differential property-based tests: HashBackend vs Plonky3Backend.
//!
//! **Property 9: Differential Backend Semantic Equivalence**
//! For any valid trace and constraint system, proofs generated by
//! HashBackend and Plonky3Backend shall have identical public inputs
//! (root_init, root_final, observables, domain, version). The backends
//! attest to the same semantic execution despite different cryptographic
//! mechanisms (SHA3-256 commitments vs STARK simulation).
//!
//! **Validates: Requirements 4.1, 4.2, 4.3, 4.4**
//!
//! The entire file is gated behind `#[cfg(feature = "plonky3-backend")]`
//! since it requires both backends to be available.

// Feature: production-readiness, Property 9: Differential Backend Semantic Equivalence

#![cfg(feature = "plonky3-backend")]

